MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Colton. Two things.

First If the slopes do not differ, then one should refit to a common allometry model of: Y~csize + group. Then one obtains residuals.

Second, one must add the overall mean back to the residuals so they resemble the original shape.

Dean

