Leonardo,

This error is telling you that your data are not in the correct format. The function ‘estimate.missing’ requires a 3D array, and I suspect you have not read your data into R in a manner that allows for this. Since there is no direct function for reading data from landmark editor, you will first need to read your files into R, and then convert them to a 3D array. The geomorph function ‘arrayspecs’ can help with the latter.

